# Tax History

Append-only chronological log of notable tax events. Skill reads this for continuity; user writes to it after major events.

Format: `## YYYY-MM-DD — <short title>` followed by a brief narrative.

---

## YYYY-MM-DD — <example: IRS Letter 0012C for 2022>

- Notice code, date received, response deadline
- Year covered
- Issue summary
- Resolution and date (if closed)
- Any carryforward impact

## YYYY-MM-DD — <example: Form 2553 S-corp election>

- Entity, effective date, filed date, IRS ack date

## YYYY-MM-DD — <example: sold rental property>

- Property, sale price, basis, gain character (ordinary / §1231 / §1250 recapture)
- §1031 exchange or taxable sale?
- Impact on passive loss suspension release

## YYYY-MM-DD — <example: §1202 QSBS acquisition>

- Company, share count, cost basis, acquisition date
- 5-year hold clock
- Original issuance or later transfer?
